on-ligatures;\">3.将php_xlswriter.dll、php_xlswriter.pdb放在PHP的ext目录</span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><br></span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">4.在php.ini中增加extension=xlswriter</span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><br></span></font><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">5.重启php【或站点】</span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><br></span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><b>Linux 安装:</b></span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><b><br></b></span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">1.下载:https://pecl.php.net/package/xlswriter</span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\"><br></span></font></h4><pre><font color=\"#4f4f4f\" face=\"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Arial, SimSun\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; 